          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What sleepwear products can you manufacture?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture pyjama sets including tops and bottoms, nightgowns in various lengths from short to long, robes including kimono and wrap styles, sleep shorts for warm weather, camisoles and chemises, loungewear sets for relaxed home wear, and onesies for cozy comfort. We produce both men's and women's sleepwear, with different minimum order quantities for each category. Our facility handles both simple sleepwear items and more complex constructions requiring specialized techniques."
          }
