          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We hold OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certification for chemical safety in all sleepwear fabrics, ensuring they are free from harmful substances suitable for prolonged skin contact during sleep. We also hold BSCI certification for social compliance, ISO 9001 for quality management, and GOTS for organic cotton when applicable. These certifications ensure our sleepwear meets international standards for safety, quality, and ethical production. Additional certifications such as Fair Trade can be arranged as required."
          }
        },
