      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order quantity for sleepwear?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Our minimum order quantity for custom sleepwear is 300 pieces per style. This minimum allows you to access factory-direct pricing while testing market response with manageable inventory. The 300-piece minimum can be distributed across sizes within a single colorway. For sleepwear sets counted as single styles, the minimum applies to the complete set. Lower quantities are available for sampling and prototype development at higher per-piece costs for brands requiring smaller initial runs.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What fabric options do you offer for sleepwear?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We offer modal for luxurious softness and drape (130-160 GSM), bamboo for sustainable antimicrobial properties (140-170 GSM), cotton for natural comfort (150-200 GSM), satin for elegant sheen and smoothness (130-160 GSM), microfiber for durability and easy care (140-180 GSM), and flannel for warmth (180-220 GSM). All fabrics are tested for skin safety and comfort. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, intended use, and brand positioning, with lighter weights for warm climates and heavier weights for cold weather.</p>
        </div>
        
