          <p class="faq__answer">We manufacture pyjama sets including tops and bottoms, nightgowns in various lengths from short to long, robes including kimono and wrap styles, sleep shorts for warm weather, camisoles and chemises, loungewear sets for relaxed home wear, and onesies for cozy comfort. We produce both men's and women's sleepwear, with different minimum order quantities for each category. Our facility handles both simple sleepwear items and more complex constructions requiring specialized techniques.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you offer sustainable sleepwear options?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We offer bamboo sleepwear for sustainable softness with antimicrobial properties, organic cotton certified by GOTS for natural fiber sustainability, and modal produced from sustainably managed beech wood forests. All sustainable options maintain the same quality standards as conventional fabrics. Bamboo and modal cost approximately 10-15% more than conventional cotton, while organic cotton costs 15-20% more. Certification documentation is provided for marketing substantiation and retailer compliance requirements.</p>
        </div>
        
